File Index

/auth-introspect-client.test.ts
Purpose: signAssertion shape/cross-keypair rejection/ms-unit window, introspect() success/valid-false/non-2xx-throw/network-error-propagation via mocked fetch.

/auth-introspect-client.ts
Purpose: Signs a compact Ed25519 { service, iat, exp, nonce } assertion (epoch MILLISECONDS — matches auth-server's service-key-store.ts, NOT Unix seconds) and calls auth-server's POST /api/introspect; deliberately duplicates the compact format from apps/auth-server/src/crypto-primitives.ts rather than importing across the app boundary (Phase 2 plan's Constraints).

/express-service.ts
Purpose: Provides a standardized Express.js service configuration with security defaults and environment-based setup.

/index.ts
Purpose: This file re-exports all services to simplify imports throughout the application, including auth-introspect-client.ts (Phase 2 centralized auth).

/logger-service.ts
Purpose: Provides structured logging with file rotation, JSON formatting, and SOH detection for server applications.

/mud-client-service.ts
Purpose: Manages MUD client connections and sessions with unique identifiers.

/telnet-client-service.ts
Purpose: Provides telnet client functionality with GMCP support and rate-limited message sending.
